$ Offset plates (ZOFFS) in the xz-plane, axial load at the grids. The offset is along the element normal. The bug applied it
$ along global z in stress recovery, which gave NXX = 380 instead of 5.
$pyNastran: version=msc
$pyNastran: punch=False
$pyNastran: encoding=utf-8
$pyNastran: nnodes=33
$pyNastran: nelements=20
$EXECUTIVE CONTROL DECK
ID VB,shell offset
SOL 101
CEND
$CASE CONTROL DECK
ECHO = NONE
GPFORCE = ALL
FORCE = ALL
TITLE = shell offset
SUBCASE 1
    LOAD = 1
SUBCASE 2
    LOAD = 2
SUBCASE 3
    DISPLACEMENT = ALL
    LOAD = 3
    STRESS = ALL
BEGIN BULK
$ Drilling DOFs rely on AUTOSPC, so no drilling stiffness whatever the default is.
PARAM,K6ROT,0.0
$PARAMS
PARAM*              POST              -1
*
PARAM*          QUAD4TYP          MITC4+
*
